shaping the future of AI for the public good. At Safer AI, you’ll work on high-impact problems alongside experts from diverse backgrounds, with a culture that values rigour, humility, and long-term thinking.</p></div></div> </div> </div> </div> </section><section class="jobs" id="in99emi36j"> <link href="https://www.safer-ai.org/t/assets/css/jobs.css?ver=1.0.69" rel="stylesheet"/> <div class="container"> <div class="grid" x-data="view"> <div class="col-12-sm"> <div class="t--fadedown">\n<h5>Current Opportunities</h5>\n</div> </div> </div> <div class="grid" x-data="view(true)"> <div class="col-6-md t--fadedown"> <div class="item"> <a href="https://www.safer-ai.org/jobs/founding-engineer-infrastructure"></a> <div class="top mh" data-mh="item"> <div class="logo"><img src="https://www.safer-ai.org/t/assets/img/symbol.svg"/></div> <div class="title">Founding Engineer (Infrastructure)</div> <div class="excerpt">                   SaferAI is hiring for a Founding Engineer role on its Evaluations team. This role offers a direct opportunity to shape how the world\'s leading AI companies manage risk at a pivotal moment.                </div> </div> <div class="cta"><div class="btn">apply</div></div> </div> </div> <div class="col-6-md t--fadedown"> <div class="item"> <a href="https://www.safer-ai.org/jobs/research-scientist-engineer"></a> <div class="top mh" data-mh="item"> <div class="logo"><img src="https://www.safer-ai.org/t/assets/img/symbol.svg"/></div> <div class="title">Research Scientist/Engineer</div> <div class="excerpt">                   SaferAI is hiring for a Research Engineer or Research Scientist on its Evaluations team. This role offers a direct opportunity to shape how the world\'s leading AI companies manage risk at a pivotal moment.                </div> </div> <div class="cta"><div class="btn">apply</div></div> </div> </div> <div class="col-6-md t--fadedown"> <div class="item"> <a href="https://www.safer-ai.org/jobs/risk-modeling-lead"></a> <div class="top mh" data-mh="item"> <div class="logo"><img src="https://www.safer-ai.org/t/assets/img/symbol.svg"/></div> <div class="title">Risk Modeling Lead</div> <div class="excerpt">                   SaferAI is hiring a senior researcher to lead our risk modeling work across cyber, CBRN, and loss-of-control risks from frontier AI. This is an epistemic-leadership role: you will set the intellectual direction of an evolving technical field and push it forward.                </div> </div> <div class="cta"><div class="btn">apply</div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section>\n<!-- LAYOUT:FOOTER -->\n</main>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
